*** TsCache:

o Implement a hash table mapping dataset name to TsCache.  This would
  allow us to reuse a single TsCache connection between multiple
  GeoPyramids (also requires translating between OI and DEM UV
  coordinate systems).
o Automatically initialize TsCache memory size based on system memory
  size.
? Fixup potential race conditions in reference counting.
o Figure out how to do request lists properly with multiple
  connections to a TsCache.
o Revamp tile requesting mechanism using double-buffered
  single-threaded request lists.  Include ability to check for a
  "completed" request list.

